{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/logDomain"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/glib\/logdomain"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines the log domain. See "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"#log-domains"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"logDomain","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Libraries should define this so that any messages","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"which they log can be differentiated from messages from other","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"libraries and application code. But be careful not to define","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"it in any public header files.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Log domains must be unique, and it is recommended that they are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application or library name, optionally followed by a hyphen and a sub-domain"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"name. For example, "},{"code":"bloatpad","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":"bloatpad-io","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If undefined, it defaults to the default "},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"code":"\"\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") log domain; this is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"not advisable, as it cannot be filtered against using the ","type":"text"},{"code":"G_MESSAGES_DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"environment variable.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, GTK uses this in its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Makefile.am"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["AM_CPPFLAGS = -DG_LOG_DOMAIN=\\\"Gtk\\\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Applications can choose to leave it as the default ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\""},{"type":"text","text":")"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"domain. However, defining the domain offers the same advantages as","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"above.","type":"text"}]}]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GLib"}],"roleHeading":"Global Variable","externalID":"s:4GLib9logDomainSivp","title":"logDomain","role":"symbol","symbolKind":"var","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"logDomain"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}]},"references":{"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib/logDomain":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Defines the log domain. See "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"#log-domains","type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"title":"logDomain","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib\/logDomain","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/glib\/logdomain","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"logDomain"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"#log-domains":{"url":"#log-domains","title":"Log Domains","identifier":"#log-domains","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Log Domains"}],"type":"link"},"doc://GLib/documentation/GLib":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GLib\/documentation\/GLib","title":"GLib","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/glib","kind":"symbol","role":"collection"}}}